# Copy to .env.test and fill in. Never commit .env.test.
#
# Redis runs via Docker mapped to a host port (Redis has no replica-set discovery,
# so it works fine from the Windows host).
TEST_REDIS_URL=redis://127.0.0.1:6380/15
#
# Mongo runs via mongodb-memory-server, which launches THIS mongod executable as a
# native single-node replica set (see test/globalSetup.ts). We do NOT use Docker for
# Mongo: Docker Desktop on Windows can't reach a Mongo replica set from the host
# (RS SDAM never finds a primary — confirmed with both Prisma and the raw driver).
# Point this at any local mongod (MongoDB 6/7/8). Example (Windows):
MONGOMS_SYSTEM_BINARY=C:\Program Files\MongoDB\Server\8.2\bin\mongod.exe
